<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Effecten GmbH has issued six million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Bankers Trust International said.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> PUT A	   650.0	 1.87 DEM	 10.69 PCT    28.25 X</p>
<p> PUT B	   675.0	 2.32 DEM	  8.26 PCT    22.94 X</p>
<p> PUT C	   700.0	 2.93 DEM	  5.86 PCT    18.13 X</p>
<p> CALL D	  700.0	 4.66 DEM	  8.43 PCT    11.40 X</p>
<p> CALL E	  725.0	 3.60 DEM	 10.01 PCT    14.73 X</p>
<p> CALL F	  750.0	 2.68 DEM	 11.80 PCT    19.90 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.NOV.96-05.NOV.97   PAYDATE	19.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   BER FFT DDF HAM STG   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  702.40</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
